oster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7BsvSuDQuoqhWmU2fL7W2GOcZHU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5En0fmDagt3Pk8d7P3uTwfeQceg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tony Lip, a bouncer in 1962, is hired to drive pianist Don Shirley on a tour through the Deep South in the days when African Americans, forced to find alternate accommodations and services due to segregation laws below the Mason-Dixon Line, relied on a guide called The Negro Motorist Green Book.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":359724,\"title\":\"Ford v Ferrari\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dR1Ju50iudrOh3YgfwkAU1g2HZe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vq5GTJOahE03mNYZGxIynlHcWr.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"American car designer Carroll Shelby and the British-born driver Ken Miles work together to battle corporate interference, the laws of physics, and their own personal demons to build a revolutionary race car for Ford Motor Company and take on the dominating race cars of Enzo Ferrari at the 24 Hours of Le Mans in France in 1966.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":530915,\"title\":\"1917\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2lBOQK06tltt8SQaswgb8d657Mv.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":466420,\"title\":\"Killers of the Flower Moon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dB6Krk806zeqd0YNp2ngQ9zXteH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jwjCWMPWSQ7h3sqG4mqI7pMEZu0.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When oil is discovered in 1920s Oklahoma under Osage Nation land, the Osage people are murdered one by one—until the FBI steps in to unravel the mystery.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":381284,\"title\":\"Hidden Figures\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9lfz2W2uGjyow3am00rsPJ8iOyq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rfkIeCaIHhN3K5wjJJqKmfUjYp8.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The untold story of Katherine G. Johnson, Dorothy Vaughan and Mary Jackson – brilliant African-American women working at NASA and serving as the brains behind one of the greatest operations in history – the launch of astronaut John Glenn into orbit. The visionary trio crossed all gender and race lines to inspire generations to dream big.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1317149,\"title\":\"I Swear\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vUwyhNWBKkSwK8ELvEeBRwV724h.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4mKczHAW4XPDXGk7V5k7Ui3dgUk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Diagnosed with Tourette Syndrome at 15, John Davidson navigates his way against the odds through troubled teenage years and into adulthood, finding inspiration in the kindness of others to discover his true purpose in life.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"FIUvabAzV20\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":135}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}